Package: caelestia-installer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, sudo
Recommends: xdg-utils
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: 12errh <12errh@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/12errh/caelestia-ubuntu
Description: Caelestia for Ubuntu graphical installer
 Runs the caelestia-ubuntu setup/update/uninstall scripts with a GUI:
 system checks, install options, live progress, a wallpaper and settings
 panel, a revision updater with keep/revert/repair, and the built-in guide.
 .
 This package installs the installer app only. The Caelestia desktop
 (Hyprland + Quickshell) is built by the app from pinned upstream commits.
